  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Ramón Salvador Águeda is a Spanish property developer associated with Elche and the wider Alicante and Murcia markets. He led Grupo RS and was the principal shareholder of Residencial Mira Llevant, pursuing land transactions and housing developments. He also represented his local industry as president of the Elche builders' association.",
    "confidence": {
      "score": 86,
